From 5023ad9c601eb640fed445d77036534e85a13d89 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Suresh, Prashanth" <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 05:53:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] vpl-gpu-rt: Wire in missing enctools include dir for
 Android.mk build

A real build (10m13s in, 5537/41711 targets) failed with a fatal
"'mfxenctools-int.h' file not found" compiling mfx_utils_extbuf.h, via
the include chain av1ehw_xe2_lin.cpp -> av1ehw_base_general.h ->
av1ehw_base.h -> mfx_utils_extbuf.h.

mfx_utils_extbuf.h and its #include "mfxenctools-int.h" both predate
this version bump -- this file was simply never part of the compiled
closure in the old Android.mk build. The intel-onevpl-26.2.3 AV1
encoder refactor (agnostic/Xe2 -> agnostic/base, seen in prior commits
in this series) now pulls it in via av1ehw_base_general.h for the
first time. The real header lives at
_studio/shared/enctools/include/mfxenctools-int.h, a directory never
wired into MFX_LOCAL_INCLUDES_HW.

Checked for a naming collision with the unrelated, incompatible
_studio/enctools/include/mfx_ienctools.h (different API, a struct vs.
class with a different method set) -- that directory is confirmed not
wired into Android.mk, so no ambiguity is introduced.

mfx_utils_extbuf.h's other includes (mfx_common.h, resolved since the
compiler reached line 31 past it; mfxencodestats.h and the relative
../mediasdk_structures/ts_ext_buffers_decl.h, both already covered by
the libmfx_gen_headers header library's exported api/vpl and
api/mediasdk_structures dirs) do not need any changes.

Tracked-On: NIACP3-1547
Signed-off-by: Suresh, Prashanth <prashanth.suresh@intel.com>
---
 _studio/mfx_lib/Android.mk | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/_studio/mfx_lib/Android.mk b/_studio/mfx_lib/Android.mk
index 9f2eaf5e..a71da6e7 100644
--- a/_studio/mfx_lib/Android.mk
+++ b/_studio/mfx_lib/Android.mk
@@ -179,6 +179,7 @@ MFX_LOCAL_INCLUDES_HW := \
     $(MFX_HOME)/_studio/mfx_lib/encode_hw/shared \
     $(MFX_HOME)/_studio/mfx_lib/shared/include \
     $(MFX_HOME)/_studio/mfx_lib/shared/include/feature_blocks \
+    $(MFX_HOME)/_studio/shared/enctools/include \
     $(MFX_HOME)/_studio/mfx_lib/scheduler/linux/include \
     $(MFX_HOME)/_studio/mfx_lib/scheduler/agnostic/include \
     $(MFX_HOME)/_studio/shared/asc/include
-- 
